  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity development of AMCs, phase 2, SALAR - Capacity development of AMCFED, phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kapacitetsutvecklign av F&#xf6;reningen f&#xf6;r Kommuner och St&#xe4;der , phase 2, SALAR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">15476 Capacity development of AMCs, phase 2, SALAR
Overall?project?objective:

Strengthened AMCs foster the creation of a conducive framework for local governments service&#xa0;provision to citizens equally in line with AMCs strategic priority areas
&#x2022; Outcome area 1: AMCs have improved prospects for their organizational and financial&#xa0;sustainability and strategic orientation with stronger member and stakeholder engagement.
&#x2022; Outcome area 2: LGs/members contribute to the provision and benefit from higher quality AMC&#xa0;services in the areas of local government finances and resources, the impact of EU accession and&#xa0;localizing SDG 5.
&#x2022; Outcome area 3: LG take into account AMC policy positions and acts towards changing the legal&#xa0;and institutional setting in response to LGs positions on LG finance and resources, including access&#xa0;to EU funding.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det generella m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r projektet &#xe4;r st&#xe4;rkandet av F&#xf6;reningen f&#xf6;r Kommuner och St&#xe4;der (AMCs). D&#xe4;rtill att fr&#xe4;mja utvecklingen av ett g&#xf6;rligt ramverk f&#xf6;r lokala regeringars (LG) st&#xf6;dfunktioner till medborgare i linje med dess strategiskt prioriterade omr&#xe5;den.  Dessa &#xe4;r f&#xf6;ljande,

&#x2022;Resultatomr&#xe5;de 1: AMCs har f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade utsikter f&#xf6;r deras organisatoriska och finansiella stabilitet, samt &#xf6;kat engagemang fr&#xe5;n medlemmar och relevanta akt&#xf6;rer. 
&#x2022;Resultatomr&#xe5;de 2: LGs/medlemmar bidrar till utbytet av f&#xf6;rdelar med h&#xf6;gkvalitativa st&#xf6;dfunktioner fr&#xe5;n kommuner och st&#xe4;der, r&#xf6;rande resurser och finansiella fr&#xe5;gor, anslutning till EU och att lokalt f&#xf6;rankra h&#xe5;llbarhetsm&#xe5;l fem (Gender Equality in Local Governance). 
&#x2022;Resultatomr&#xe5;de 3: LG tar h&#xe4;nsyn till AMC policy och agerar j&#xe4;mtemot LGs f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar i finanser och resurser i att &#xe4;ndra den r&#xe4;ttsliga och institutionella milj&#xf6;n. D&#xe4;rtill m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra EU bidrag. 
.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall Objective of the project is to strengthen Association of Municipalities and Cities (AMCs) and foster the creation of a conducive framework for local governments (LG) service provision to citizens equally in line with AMCs strategic priority areas.
&#x2022; Outcome area 1: AMCs have improved prospects for their organizational and financial sustainability and strategic orientation with stronger member and stakeholder engagement.
&#x2022; Outcome area 2: LGs/members contribute to the provision and benefit from higher quality AMC services in the areas of local government finances and resources, the impact of EU accession and localizing SDG 5 (Gender Equality in local governance).
&#x2022; Outcome area 3: LG take into account AMC policy positions and acts towards changing the legal and institutional setting in response to LGs positions on LG finance and resources, including access to EU funding..</narrative>
  </description>
